WEBVTT

00:04:58.377 --> 00:05:00.421
electrical systems;

00:05:00.463 --> 00:05:04.508
manual drive, train and axles;
and engine performance.

00:05:05.885 --> 00:05:07.219
Now you take those

00:05:07.261 --> 00:05:12.058
and you couple with the fact that Brandice
is actually managing a team of technicians

00:05:12.058 --> 00:05:13.225
on the floor.

00:05:14.602 --> 00:05:16.520
You assess all of that,

00:05:16.562 --> 00:05:22.068
and she finds out that she's just
a few credits shy of a college degree,

00:05:22.109 --> 00:05:26.238
a degree in automotive engineering
or engineering management.

00:05:27.281 --> 00:05:29.033
And then on top of that,

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:30.785
during that assessment,